1
00:00:00.398 --> 00:00:04.282
Unit fifteen. Non-Communicable Diseases!

2
00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:09.617
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.767
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:17.245
Today we learn about Non-Communicable Diseases. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.406 --> 00:00:22.506
NCD. Say it with me. NCD!

6
00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:30.451
Heart disease. Say it with me. Heart disease!

7
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:38.223
Diabetes. Say it with me. Diabetes!

8
00:00:41.703 --> 00:00:45.453
Cancer. Say it with me. Cancer!

9
00:00:49.012 --> 00:00:53.245
Lung disease. Say it with me. Lung disease!

10
00:00:56.668 --> 00:01:01.351
Risk factors. Say it with me. Risk factors!

11
00:01:04.862 --> 00:01:08.928
Lifestyle. Say it with me. Lifestyle!

12
00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:16.293
Prevention. Say it with me. Prevention!

13
00:01:19.798 --> 00:01:34.951
Non-communicable diseases (NCDs) like heart disease, diabetes, cancer, and lung disease are not spread from person to person. Risk factors include tobacco, poor diet, inactivity, and alcohol. Healthy lifestyle choices help prevention.

14
00:01:35.001 --> 00:01:38.218
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:44.393
