16
00:01:44.443 --> 00:01:45.593
Diabetes!

17
00:01:46.847 --> 00:01:52.030
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.230
Lifestyle!

19
00:01:54.412 --> 00:02:00.481
Did you know? NCDs cause about 7 in every 10 deaths worldwide!

20
00:02:00.531 --> 00:02:03.267
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.001 --> 00:02:12.761
Think and answer. Which NCD risk factors can people change?

22
